{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02896","headline":"和左仆射燕公春日端居述怀 · 任希古","name":"和左仆射燕公春日端居述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丰野光三杰，嬀庭赞五臣。\n绨缃歌美誉，丝竹咏芳尘。\n圣历开环象，昌年降甫申。\n高门非舍筑，华构岂垂纶。\n凤邸抟霄翰，龙池跃海鳞。\n玉鼎昇黄阁，金章谒紫宸。\n礼闱通政本，文昌总国均。\n调风振薄俗，清教叙彝伦。\n星回应缇管，日御警寅宾。\n叶上曾槐变，花发小堂春。\n思挂五都冕，言访北山巾。\n赫赫容台上，千祀耀平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任希古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}